    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Have you read any of Gogol's books?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now imagine that you will have a chance to visit his worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To meet the collegiate assessor Kovalev or to communicate with Chichikov?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our project will give you such an opportunity through the prism of a fourteen-year-old girl's terrible dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each dream is a nightmare based on one of the books of classic writers. And only by overcoming them, the girl will be able to overcome her personal problems, fears and feelings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422840/extras/53679bdff9b00d474e868ed474ba6d29.poster.avif?t=1755162196\" width=800 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422840/extras/53679bdff9b00d474e868ed474ba6d29.webm?t=1755162196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422840/extras/53679bdff9b00d474e868ed474ba6d29.mp4?t=1755162196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player will have his own \u2018base\u2019, which will change from passing nightmares. This is a girl's room from the 80's.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travelling through the nightmares, the player will have to solve puzzles, escape and hide.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422840/extras/5b53ff07bbdcfa4197ae517049e5f2bb.poster.avif?t=1755162196\" width=800 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422840/extras/5b53ff07bbdcfa4197ae517049e5f2bb.webm?t=1755162196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422840/extras/5b53ff07bbdcfa4197ae517049e5f2bb.mp4?t=1755162196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Each nightmare is unique in its own way and is filled with motives of one of the writer's books. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like the project, we will release additions based on other books and writers. Nightmares are different, and we have already collected a lot of ideas for their realisation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each nightmare is a metamorphosis of episodes from a girl's life.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Have you read any of Gogol's books?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now imagine that you will have a chance to visit his worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To meet the collegiate assessor Kovalev or to communicate with Chichikov?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our project will give you such an opportunity through the prism of a fourteen-year-old girl's terrible dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each dream is a nightmare based on one of the books of classic writers. And only by overcoming them, the girl will be able to overcome her personal problems, fears and feelings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422840/extras/53679bdff9b00d474e868ed474ba6d29.poster.avif?t=1755162196\" width=800 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422840/extras/53679bdff9b00d474e868ed474ba6d29.webm?t=1755162196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422840/extras/53679bdff9b00d474e868ed474ba6d29.mp4?t=1755162196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player will have his own \u2018base\u2019, which will change from passing nightmares. This is a girl's room from the 80's.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travelling through the nightmares, the player will have to solve puzzles, escape and hide.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422840/extras/5b53ff07bbdcfa4197ae517049e5f2bb.poster.avif?t=1755162196\" width=800 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422840/extras/5b53ff07bbdcfa4197ae517049e5f2bb.webm?t=1755162196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3422840/extras/5b53ff07bbdcfa4197ae517049e5f2bb.mp4?t=1755162196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Each nightmare is unique in its own way and is filled with motives of one of the writer's books. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like the project, we will release additions based on other books and writers. Nightmares are different, and we have already collected a lot of ideas for their realisation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each nightmare is a metamorphosis of episodes from a girl's life.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A psychedelic 1st-person immersive nightmare horror game steeped in the atmosphere of the works of classic writers.",
